{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/803974-urban-myth-about-halloween","id":803974,"title":"Urban Myth about Halloween","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-08T13:28:18-08:00","id":803974,"title":"Urban Myth about Halloween","content":"any idea how to incorporate &quot;Poisoned candy, or &quot;Razor blades in candied apples&quot; Into a game, its scary its creepy... its also in my opinion appropiate to CWOD... but how can you investigate a crime that only becomes possible once a year?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-08T15:06:48-08:00","id":804043,"title":"","content":"Well if it's been going on for X number of years in one area shouldn't be too hard....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-08T17:39:13-08:00","id":804142,"title":"","content":"Put twists on them.<br /> <br /> a vampire every year does something with apples and razor blades. This year its a pool party. The pool water has hundreds of apples bobbing in it. The slides into the pool has razor blades half way down the chutes. Decide what they did and the area they targeted years past to have a trail for others to gain clues.<br /> <br /> Mad cults for banes lace treats with secretions from their strange powers and tainted abilities giving normal everyday people frenzy like homicidal episodes. The people investigating figure out people/family they know have been trick or treating in that area.<br /> <br /> Evil spirits are crossing the gauntlet and being mistaken for children in costumes. What will they do when they dont get the chiminage they want after knocking on those doors. What will they do if they do get what they want,<br /> <br /> Thaumaturgical sabbat have created a new challenge. They've created a ritual that imbides anything with powerful vitae from an elder. Rumour has it this year theres 5 pieces of candy with draughts of elder blood imbided. One of the pieces actually has the final draught and possible diablerie opportunity for whichever sabbat cainite finds it.<br /> <br /> of course, all five pieces were given out to earlier. Now the hunt is on. But where and in who's stomachs are the pieces?<br /> <br /> Just off the top of my head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-08T17:47:53-08:00","id":804149,"title":"","content":"i would go with something darker.....<br /> <br /> make it be human. let your players have all the conspiracy theories about &quot;was the sabbath&quot; or &quot;The Nephandi.&quot; or &quot;Cultists.&quot; but have it being just a guy. a normal human from your Pc's neighbourg. make them care about the humans in their lifes and that theres a threat around them that they haven't noticed yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T02:34:38-08:00","id":804305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/803974-urban-myth-about-halloween?p=804149#post804149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i would go with something darker.....<br /> <br /> make it be human. let your players have all the conspiracy theories about &quot;was the sabbath&quot; or &quot;The Nephandi.&quot; or &quot;Cultists.&quot; but have it being just a guy. a normal human from your Pc's neighbourg. make them care about the humans in their lifes and that theres a threat around them that they haven't noticed yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now that is something that's forgotten way too often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T13:29:55-08:00","id":804664,"title":"","content":"I agree its what I was thinking... but how to get PC's on a investigation... changelings , especialy childlings would want to protect humans, vamps like to keep the herd docile, Garou would probaly suspect some kind of wyrm involvement and even if it isnt being ENGINEERED by pentex or banes, see the wyrm BREEDING in such activitys...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T18:23:36-08:00","id":805663,"title":"","content":"Well, if you're playing a <b>Changeling</b> game, it becomes easier. Halloween is sacred to the pooka (fae pranksters). On October 31st, they celebrate &quot;Pranksgiving&quot; with intricate plots and schemes, each one striving to prove themselves the cleverest. And not all the fun and games are survivable . . .<br /> <br /> If the PCs already have an evil pooka nemesis, then they're likely to know in advance that he (or she) is going to pull some horrific, high body count prank. All they have to do is figure out what his scheme is . . . and a way to stop it, before people start dying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T05:34:31-08:00","id":806932,"title":"","content":"Vampire could have 'poisoned' candy in that it has a vamp's blood in it and so everyone that eats it is ghouled instantly. Something like that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblos